prompt:
Extract this business request as one JSON object, without Markdown or additional keys:
{"action":"integration|migration|reporting|unknown","source":string|null,"target":string|null,"deadline":string|null,"review_required":boolean,"evidence":{"source":string|null,"target":string|null,"deadline":string|null}}
Choose exactly one action: integration for recurring sync, migration for one-time moves, reporting for comparison/reporting, unknown otherwise. Preserve exact system names. Only return an explicitly current ISO YYYY-MM-DD deadline. Missing or ambiguous fields are null. Evidence must quote exact input text supporting each non-null source, target and deadline; otherwise evidence is null. Set review_required to true for unknown action, missing source, or missing target for integration/migration. Missing deadline alone does not require review. Reporting does not require a target.
